  "step_3": "The decision reason requires that the individual considers the probability of a favorable outcome and prefers the lottery with the higher probability. However, in the verbal report, the individual does not consider the probability difference as significant or relevant. Instead, they justify their choice based on the higher monetary amount, even when the probability is slightly lower. Therefore, the individual did not apply the decision reason — they ignored the probability difference and focused on the payout amount. The information considered (payout amount) does not align with the relevant information for the decision reason (probability of favorable outcome). The justification (choosing higher prize despite lower probability) contradicts the rule of the decision reason (preferring higher probability). Thus, the decision reason was not used.",
